      "id": 28,
      "title": "RAG Retrieval",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "For each stage of a RAG query in the time range: the queries, and the p50, p95 and mean of the duration. total is the whole query, from embedding the query to the ranked results. embedding is the query embedding through the gateway. search is the Qdrant searches, which run at once, so the stage takes as long as the slower search. ranking is the local ranking of the results. Each quantile is its own, so the stages need not add up to total. Queries sent before #975 carry no stage and are left out. Metric: devops_cli_rag_query_duration_ms. Approximate: increase() needs two samples of a series inside its window, and delta points from one process can arrive out of order (#792), so a share or a quantile can come out high or low.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p50"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Mean"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "Queries"
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "round(histogram_count(sum by (stage) (increase(devops_cli_rag_query_duration_ms{job=~\"$job\",stage=~\"total|embedding|search|ranking\"}[$__range]))))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (stage) (increase(devops_cli_rag_query_duration_ms{job=~\"$job\",stage=~\"total|embedding|search|ranking\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (stage) (increase(devops_cli_rag_query_duration_ms{job=~\"$job\",stage=~\"total|embedding|search|ranking\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_avg(sum by (stage) (increase(devops_cli_rag_query_duration_ms{job=~\"$job\",stage=~\"total|embedding|search|ranking\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Latency: RAG query stages in the range",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Queries",
              "Value #B": "p50",
              "Value #C": "p95",
              "Value #D": "Mean"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "desc": true,
                "field": "Queries"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Qdrant requests retried in the time range after a transient error, by client operation and error type, from the most down. The error type is the class of the error behind the retry, taken from inside the ResponseHandlingException the Qdrant client wraps transport errors in: RemoteProtocolError for a keep-alive connection the tunnel closed while idle, ConnectError for a refused connection, ReadTimeout for a request that waited out qdrant.timeout, 300 s by default. Each retry reconnects after a pause of 0.5 s times the attempt number, which a search spends in the search stage. Metric: devops_cli_qdrant_retries_total. Approximate: increase() needs two samples of a series inside its window, and delta points from one process can arrive out of order (#792), so a count can come out low.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 16,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "minVizHeight": 16,
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [],
          "fields": "/^Value$/",
          "values": true
        },
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "sizing": "auto",
        "valueMode": "text"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "round(sum by (operation, error_type) (increase(devops_cli_qdrant_retries_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} {{error_type}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Errors: Qdrant retries in the range",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "desc": true,
                "field": "Value"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The share of the embedding cache lookups that a cache answered, from the memory cache of the process or from Valkey, over a window of $__rate_interval, at least 1 h (Min step 15m). A window with lookups and no hits shows 0. Each text that an embedding request gets is one lookup. Metric: devops_cli_embedding_cache_lookups_total. Approximate: increase() needs two samples of a series inside its window, and delta points from one process can arrive out of order (#792), so a share or a quantile can come out high or low.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisLabel": "Hit share (%)",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 26,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(devops_cli_embedding_cache_lookups_total{job=~\"$job\",result=\"hit\"}[$__rate_interval])) or sum(increase(devops_cli_embedding_cache_lookups_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0) / sum(increase(devops_cli_embedding_cache_lookups_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "hit share",
          "interval": "15m"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cache: share of embedding lookups that hit",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      }
